<title>USA: ST PAUL CATTLE TRADE STEADY - USDA.</title>
<headline>ST PAUL CATTLE TRADE STEADY - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compared to Thursday, slaughter steers, heifers and Holstein steers sold fully steady. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers: Choice 2-4 1200-1400 lbs 63.00-64.75.</p>
<p>Select and Choice 2-3 1250-1500 lbs 61.40-63.00.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers: Choice 2-4 package 1055 lbs 62.50. Select and Choice 2-3 couple packages 1116-1165 lbs 61.70-61.85.</p>
</text>
